<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="6f078967">&lt;p&gt;
    Build out the functional application role design in the security functional design document with input from the client.
    Present to key client stakeholders the updated business process flows with the relevant segregation of duties (SoD) and
    sensitive access (SA) risks highlighted. Based on the identified risks, inventory the associated functional
    (task-based) roles and confirm with the client any design considerations for each role, such as what the role can do,
    any key privileges, restrictions, etc.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Additionally, discuss with the client any opportunities to combine or split up roles in order to further mitigate
    risks.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
